    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203bFor the best experience, please enable voice playback in the options menu.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959650/extras/6f3beb45fb5f9adb48fbf67bb06050af.avif?t=1754388189\" width=600 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959650/extras/af41bcb6eb72203020a47b2b1a178832.avif?t=1754388189\" width=600 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, Theo, is a young man who vows to expel demons from the overworld. After going through a lot, he finally became a Brave and embarked on his journey.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The destination is the city of Manko in the Kingdom of Goodland.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vicious demons called Halphas are occupying the streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what appeared in front of Theo were cute demon girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959650/extras/b7de1d9de39648cfa155571a3fc55d00.avif?t=1754388189\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As enemies, what will happen ahead of them ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one knows the answer yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cI will liberate Manko City and make those guys who look down on me admit that I am a top-notch Brave!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959650/extras/e4e02fe23616ba17bcbf947bb9651e5c.webp?t=1754388189\" width=600 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959650/extras/1d1c25466bc2322d535cbe22eedc421b.avif?t=1754388189\" width=600 height=70 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0\u00a0<strong>Kingdom of Goodland</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A constitutional monarchy located in northwest Europe.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is composed of many islands such as Goodland Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959650/extras/c0128bfbc2a509b701bffd1ed5a35256.avif?t=1754388189\" width=600 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure takes place in a city located in the northwest of the Kingdom of Goodland\u2014Manko city.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The northern part of the Kingdom of Goodland was dominated by the demon army, and Manko city was once an important defense stronghold.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the city has fallen a few months ago</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and is currently under the control of a Demon Count named Halphas.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0\u00a0<strong>Glossary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>\u2013 Demons \u2013</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The inhabitants of the Hell Empire who live deep underground.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are more powerful than humans and they can use magic.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They established a chivalric order\u2014The Flies, which only accepts the best among the best, and launched an invasion of the overworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reason for the invasion remains unclear.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>\u2013 Bestowal \u2013</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items given by God to grant humans ability to fight against the demons.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various types such as weapons, restraint items, and items that can measure magic values.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>\u2013 Brave \u2013</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A common name for people who fight demons.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The First Brave was a title given to the first King of Goodland\u2014King Artorius.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, there is a two-year Brave School. Everyone who graduates from the Brave school and joins the Kingdom military can be called the Brave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959650/extras/e4e02fe23616ba17bcbf947bb9651e5c.webp?t=1754388189\" width=600 height=10 /></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959650/extras/a56fe72f6143d392bf5dc10e46617403.avif?t=1754388189\" width=600 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All female characters' H events are fully dubbed, and all dirty talks are not censored</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Protagonist's actions will also affect the erotic values!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the values, the sexual content may change!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959650/extras/cabf3a857a3fd1d41cc3d03cfad8d683.avif?t=1754388189\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As enemies, the demon girls are of course very resistant to the protagonist at first.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the power of the Brave to discipline their bodies and make them more erotic!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the time spent on the journey together increases, so do their affections, and they may have a lovey-dovey ending...!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's loyal to one or love for all, it's you to decide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From rape PLAY to sweet harem orgy, enjoy the shameless life with three demon girls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959650/extras/e4e02fe23616ba17bcbf947bb9651e5c.webp?t=1754388189\" width=600 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959650/extras/f04093e528f306dc467d7d91cc12dc2c.avif?t=1754388189\" width=600 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959650/extras/3391be90e66538950119db58ef87fe84.avif?t=1754388189\" width=340 height=460 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Layla Halphas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Race\u3011Demon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Age\u3011Secret</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Height\u3011162 cm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Weight\u301154 kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Breast size\u3011E cup</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Birthday\u3011December 24th</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Background\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A demon born as the second daughter of the famous Halphas family. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has a strong sex drive perhaps because of her mother being a succubus. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is interested in humans and sneaks into the overworld occasionally to observe them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her hobby is masturbating with human boyish fantasies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A virgin, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959650/extras/158b12c1d6aa40c0d1e7e192eeb86a18.avif?t=1754388189\" width=340 height=460 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mia Halphas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Race\u3011Demon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Age\u3011Secret</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Height\u3011150cm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Weight\u3011About three pears</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Breast size\u3011G cup</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Birthday\u3011May 17th</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Background\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A demon born as the third daughter of the Halphas family. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is a NEET and only left home because her parents forced her to. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She likes romance novels and is always reading them in her room. Sibling love is her favorite. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has no sexual experience at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959650/extras/8afa0c8181fb1aa08b2f1533a3d49672.avif?t=1754388189\" width=340 height=460 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rose Halphas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Race\u3011Demon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Age\u3011\u25a0\u25a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Height\u3011167cm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Weight\u3011\u25a0\u25a0kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Breast size\u3011F cup</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Birthday\u3011March 13th</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Background\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A demon born as the first daughter of Halphas family.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She was born with outstanding talents, and soon after her birth, she was treated as the heir of Count Halphas.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has a cold personality and it's hard to tell what she's thinking.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is popular because she is a beauty, but she has never had a boyfriend. Probably a virgin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959650/extras/e4e02fe23616ba17bcbf947bb9651e5c.webp?t=1754388189\" width=600 height=10 /></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959650/extras/edb3fb65f5ce8329ca611d6e409b11ee.avif?t=1754388189\" width=600 height=70 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0General</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game type: RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resolution: 1280\u00d7720</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic CGs: Over 40 (Diffs not included)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dubbing: H Events, female characters dialogue in the main story (total dubbing amount of more than 6,000 words)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Number of Endings: 5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty Setting: Yes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Illustration Costume change: Yes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pregnant Illustration: Yes</p>",
